How to handle these signals:
- `estimate_due` / `overdue`: read its progress; give it more time with task_scope (expect_minutes, with why) or nudge it with agent_send; on your own to-do, task_scope your to-do's expect_minutes.
- `idle` / `unjudged`: read its last turns with agent_read; nudge it with agent_send when it can go on, rework what is missing, or accept what is done.

You own these tasks: handle them yourself, on your own workers only. Reach up only with report_to_supervisor: kind done once every worker is closed and each criterion of your to-do is met with evidence, kind question or blocked when the owner or whoever handed you the to-do must decide. Progress reports need nothing from you.